{"year":"2026","content":[{"type":"text","content_text":"La 32.ª edición, la primera con el nombre <i>The Actor Awards</i>, se realizó el 1 de marzo de 2026 en el Shrine Auditorium, en Los Ángeles, con <a href=\"https://_{type: 'screen', 'id': 40462, 'screen_type': person}\">Kristen Bell</a> como presentadora por tercera vez y transmisión en vivo de <i>Netflix</i>. <a href=\"https://_{type: 'screen', 'id': 1233413, 'screen_type': movie}\">Sinners</a> (Pecadores, 2025) ganó el premio al elenco, y <a href=\"https://_{type: 'screen', 'id': 135651, 'screen_type': person}\">Michael B. Jordan</a> fue elegido mejor actor por el doble papel de los gemelos Smoke y Stack. <a href=\"https://_{type: 'screen', 'id': 1054867, 'screen_type': movie}\">One Battle After Another</a> (Una batalla tras otra, 2025), que se llevó el premio a actor de reparto con <a href=\"https://_{type: 'screen', 'id': 2228, 'screen_type': person}\">Sean Penn</a>, se convirtió, junto con <a href=\"https://_{type: 'screen', 'id': 1934, 'screen_type': movie}\">Shakespeare in Love</a> (Shakespeare enamorado, 1998), en una de las dos únicas películas nominadas en todas las categorías de cine en las que podía competir. <a href=\"https://_{type: 'screen', 'id': 3, 'screen_type': person}\">Harrison Ford</a> recibió el premio a la trayectoria. <i>No se incluyen los premios de televisión.</i>"},{"type":"awards_nominees","name":"Mejor Película","nominee_list":[{"type":"movie","id":1233413,"name":"Pecadores","image_path":"/v0Ljeti537c6cNKweuEN0iaU3x4.jpg","director":"Ryan Coogler","winner":true},{"type":"movie","id":1062722,"name":"Frankenstein","image_path":"/rB0tZwNImTT8febX5qVycZ5YVeF.jpg","director":"Guillermo del Toro","winner":false},{"type":"movie","id":858024,"name":"Hamnet","image_path":"/njatIGrIlZCxB88UUBC2xgmfCNE.jpg","director":"Chloé Zhao","winner":false},{"type":"movie","id":1317288,"name":"Marty Supremo","image_path":"/oLWBW1Sg9V8KGgbR3Y8jeEWF2Gi.jpg","director":"Josh Safdie","winner":false},{"type":"movie","id":1054867,"name":"Una batalla tras otra","image_path":"/2peYXW6CoruehDnKJGMjl2NuaNB.jpg","director":"Paul Thomas Anderson","winner":false}]},{"type":"awards_nominees","name":"Mejor Actriz","nominee_list":[{"type":"person","id":1498158,"name":"Jessie Buckley","image_path":"/qbz9175DERSqsCQeYWGJWwqb38z.jpg","winner":true,"movie":{"type":"movie","id":858024,"name":"Hamnet","image_path":"/njatIGrIlZCxB88UUBC2xgmfCNE.jpg","director":"Chloé Zhao"}},{"type":"person","id":9827,"name":"Rose Byrne","image_path":"/wR8YZlrewVW2FixRBrJcxaXU3R1.jpg","winner":false,"movie":{"type":"movie","id":1160360,"name":"Si pudiera, te daría una patada","image_path":"/rKmfPaOx1V2gPK9gJj5Fdg4UI44.jpg","director":"Mary Bronstein"}},{"type":"person","id":11661,"name":"Kate Hudson","image_path":"/s79lH1QzEg2fkXULKBxRmU9aNr8.jpg","winner":false,"movie":{"type":"movie","id":1371185,"name":"Song Sung Blue: Sueño inquebrantable","image_path":"/zRtwTGqMbgv2PaTSAMg0R3qfUO4.jpg","director":"Craig Brewer"}},{"type":"person","id":3914706,"name":"Chase Infiniti","image_path":"/2goENGgg9OCz7qjMmm0HNxV9Kjj.jpg","winner":false,"movie":{"type":"movie","id":1054867,"name":"Una batalla tras otra","image_path":"/2peYXW6CoruehDnKJGMjl2NuaNB.jpg","director":"Paul Thomas Anderson"}},{"type":"person","id":54693,"name":"Emma Stone","image_path":"/mstXxlDqhoK0s0molsNpskJ1wLH.jpg","winner":false,"movie":{"type":"movie","id":701387,"name":"Bugonia","image_path":"/6OeJbx1QGDwrlL8SPZeLKjLhhA7.jpg","director":"Yorgos Lanthimos"}}]},{"type":"video","video_id":"JKCdolHEoGg","information":{"contentTitle":"Los SAG Awards pasan a llamarse The Actor Awards (anuncio oficial)","source":"YouTube: Canal <i>Netflix</i>"}},{"type":"awards_nominees","name":"Mejor Actor","nominee_list":[{"type":"person","id":135651,"name":"Michael B. Jordan","image_path":"/sMBpav8cK7t7Nk0yf4tuNOqNUyW.jpg","winner":true,"movie":{"type":"movie","id":1233413,"name":"Pecadores","image_path":"/v0Ljeti537c6cNKweuEN0iaU3x4.jpg","director":"Ryan Coog